# Unity/Blender 工程与资产（可抛弃的 spike 产物）
# 注意：整目录忽略会让「spike 的 C# 源码 / 生成脚本只存在于磁盘」，一次重装工程就全丢。
# 所以这里改成：忽略生成物（Library/Builds/Scene 等），只放行源码与美术脚本。
spike/project/*
!spike/project/Assets
spike/project/Assets/*
!spike/project/Assets/Editor
!spike/project/Assets/Scripts
!spike/project/Assets/Art
spike/project/Assets/Art/*
!spike/project/Assets/Art/Shaders
spike/project/Assets/Art/Shaders/*
!spike/project/Assets/Art/Shaders/*.shader
spike/export/
spike/scratch/
spike/blend/*.blend1

